      "message": "chore(license): relicense CamCraft from MIT to Apache-2.0, copyright held by its contributors\n\nMaintainer's choice. LICENSE (and aur/LICENSE) now carry the verbatim\nApache-2.0 text. A new NOTICE names \"The CamCraft contributors\" as\ncopyright holders. The README explains that contributors hold their own\nrights and that pull requests are licensed under Apache-2.0 (license\nsection 5). The AUR, deb/rpm metadata say Apache-2.0, and every package\nships NOTICE next to LICENSE. The MIT terms the existing code was\ncontributed under are recorded in docs/decisions/452-license-apache.md;\nMIT permits this redistribution.\n\nFixes #452\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
